{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A linear indicator shows the progress of a task using a horizontal line."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can show a specific value (determinate) or just that something is in progress (indeterminate)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Best used inside layouts to show progress."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"metadata":{"title":"MISOLinearProgressIndicator","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOLinearProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOLinearProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents27MISOLinearProgressIndicatorV","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"macOS","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"tvOS","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","beta":false},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"11.0","name":"watchOS","beta":false}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"role":"symbol"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/init(progress:status:track:stopIndicator:helperText:gapSize:animated:accessibility:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/init(status:track:helperText:helperTextAlignment:gapSize:accessibility:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/HelperTextAlignment","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType"],"anchor":"Enumerations","generated":true,"title":"Enumerations"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOLinearProgressIndicator"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Indicators"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Variants","type":"heading","text":"Variants","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two variants are provided:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Determinate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the caller provides a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" value in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[0, 1]"},{"type":"text","text":". Values outside this range are coerced."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows the exact progress of a task, usually as a percentage from 0% to 100%."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provides clear and measurable feedback, helping users understand how long the task will take and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reducing uncertainty."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use determinate indicators whenever possible. Avoid indeterminate when progress can be measured, e.g."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the progress value is known (file upload, installation, data sync) or when the system can estimate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completion time or percentage."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": no "},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is provided and the indicator loops continuously."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Shows that a process is active without indicating exact progress.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Used when the system cannot determine how long the task will take.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Communicates that the system is working, even without precise data, and prevents users from thinking","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the interface is frozen.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For long loading times (over 5 seconds), additional context must be provided.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Statuses","anchor":"Statuses"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Neutral","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": default status used when progress has no specific semantic meaning. Suitable for generic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loading, processing, synchronization or background tasks."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accent"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": used to highlight primary or brand-related actions (uploads, downloads, installations,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"onboarding)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Positive","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": indicates successful progress or a process leading to a successful outcome.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Info","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates informational or system-related processes (background synchronization, data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"retrieval)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": indicates progress related to an operation that requires user attention or should be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"monitored.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Negative"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": indicates progress related to an error, recovery, cancellation or failure.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"anchor":"Gap-size","level":2,"text":"Gap size","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": standard gap between the bar and the track (base Android Material 3 specification)."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"small"}]},{"type":"text","text":": reduced gap for a more compact appearance."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Track","level":2,"text":"Track","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" (default): the track is displayed. Recommended when the indicator is shown on its own and needs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a clear structure. The track helps define the full range of progress and makes the value easier to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"read.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": the track is hidden. Recommended when the indicator is embedded inside another component","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(button, tag, toast) or when a more minimal appearance is needed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","text":"Stop indicator (determinate only)","level":2,"anchor":"Stop-indicator-determinate-only"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" (default): no stop indicator is drawn."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":": a small square (or dot if the theme uses rounded caps) is drawn at the end of the track to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identify the end of the range easily. Required by accessibility criteria when the track has a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"contrast below 3:1 with its container or the surface behind the container.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The stop indicator is only available on the determinate variant, matching the Android Material 3"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specification: the indeterminate variant has no meaningful end position for it."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Helper text","level":2,"anchor":"Helper-text"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional text displayed below the progress bar to provide context or additional information.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode, use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOLinearProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" which offers two variants:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".description(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Displays a simple description text without the progress percentage."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"alignment","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter controls horizontal alignment ("},{"code":".center","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":".start","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"code":".end","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".percent(description:alignment:)","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Displays the progress percentage with an optional description."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The percentage value and its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"%"},{"type":"text","text":" symbol are assembled through the localized wording key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"core_progressIndicator_percent_value"},{"type":"text","text":", so the symbol, its spacing and its position follow the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"typographic rules of the current language (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"75%\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in English, ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"75 %\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in French, ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"٪75\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in Arabic).","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"code":"alignment","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":".center","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default), only the percentage is shown, centered.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".start"},{"type":"text","text":", the percentage is at the leading edge and the description (if provided) at the trailing edge."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"code":"alignment","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":".end","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the description (if provided) is at the leading edge and the percentage at the trailing edge.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"text":" mode, the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"text":" parameter is a simple ","type":"text"},{"code":"String?","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with a separate "},{"code":"helperTextAlignment","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".center"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (default): The text is centered under the progress bar."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".start"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": The text is aligned to the leading edge."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The text is aligned to the trailing edge."}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Animation","type":"heading","text":"Animation","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Determinate"}]},{"text":": when ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" (default), the indicator progressively fills from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the target ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"text":" on first display and animates any subsequent change of ","type":"text"},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(based on Android Material 3 specifications). When ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the indicator is displayed instantly at its target value with no animation.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the Android Material 3 two-line animation is intrinsic to the mode and cannot be disabled from the call site; there is no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter on the indeterminate initializer."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are always disabled and a static bar filled at 70% is displayed when either","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityReduceMotion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or Low Power Mode is enabled.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Code samples","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples"},{"text":"Determinate — Basic usage","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Determinate-Basic-usage"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Determinate — default (neutral, with track, default gap, reveal animation)","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","","    \/\/ Determinate with an accent status, no track and a helper text","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5,","                                status: .accent,","                                track: false,","                                helperText: .description(\"Uploading…\"))","","    \/\/ Description aligned to the end","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5, helperText: .description(\"Uploading...\", alignment: .end))","","    \/\/ Percentage centered (default)","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, helperText: .percent())","","    \/\/ Percentage with description at start (percentage leading, description trailing)","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                helperText: .percent(description: \"of 100 MB\", alignment: .start))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info)","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(status: .accent, helperText: \"Processing…\")","","    \/\/ Helper text aligned to the end","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info,","                                helperText: \"Loading data…\",","                                helperTextAlignment: .end)","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility name and state for VoiceOver","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                accessibility: .init(name: \"download bar\", state: \"downloading\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility and helper text","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5,","                                accessibility: .init(name: \"progress bar\", state: \"step 1 of 4\"),","                                helperText: .description(\"Loading...\"))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate with accessibility","    MISOLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info,","                                accessibility: .init(name: \"loading\", state: \"processing\"))"]},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"code":"accessibility","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter to provide a custom name and state for VoiceOver:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"accessibility.name","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": The name of the component (e.g., “progress bar”, “download bar”)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility.state"},{"type":"text","text":": The state of the component (e.g., “downloading”, “step 1 of 4”)"}]}]}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"VoiceOver reads: "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"[name]. [state]. [helperText] [value]","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Example: "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"“download bar. downloading. 75 percent”","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility"},{"type":"text","text":" is not provided, the behavior is unchanged: only the helper text (if provided) is used as label."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"determinate","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" mode, the view exposes the current progress as an accessibility value (percentage)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so that Voice Over reads e.g. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“75 percent”"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", and is marked with the ","type":"text"},{"code":".updatesFrequently","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" trait so that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"assistive technologies know the value is changing. If a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"type":"text","text":" is provided, it is exposed as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"accessibility label (Voice Over reads e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"“Uploading. 75 percent”","type":"text"}]},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The indicator never captures "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Full Keyboard Access","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" focus, as no interaction is possible on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"progress indicator. On iOS 17+ \/ macOS 14+ \/ visionOS 1+ \/ watchOS 10+ \/ tvOS 17+, this is enforced"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"via "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(false)"},{"type":"text","text":"; on earlier OS versions, the semantic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".isStaticText"},{"type":"text","text":" trait is used."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode without helper text, the view is hidden from Voice Over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".accessibilityHidden(true)"},{"type":"text","text":") — and therefore also excluded from Full Keyboard Access navigation:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"there is no readable value to expose. When a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"type":"text","text":" is provided, the helper text is exposed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as accessibility label so the user still understands the context."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are disabled when ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityReduceMotion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","text":"Colored surfaces","anchor":"Colored-surfaces","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When placed on an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOColoredSurface","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the indicator switches to a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"monochrome","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rendering, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"status"},{"type":"text","text":" is ignored."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Version","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.2.0 (Figma component design version)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Since","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 3.0.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misolinearprogressindicator"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents":{"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by MISO. It contains also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"text":" extensions and ","type":"text"},{"code":"ViewModifiers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"type":"topic","title":"Components"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOLinearProgressIndicator/init(status:track:helpe